betterlockscreen for Debian
---------------------------

This package ships no configuration file. betterlockscreen reads
$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/betterlockscreenrc (usually ~/.config/betterlockscreenrc) and
falls back to /etc/betterlockscreenrc, and works with neither present.

Upstream's annotated example is installed at

  /usr/share/doc/betterlockscreen/examples/betterlockscreenrc

Copy it to one of those two paths and edit your copy. Nothing is installed into
/etc: a file shipped there would be a dpkg conffile, prompted about on every
upgrade that changed it. One you create is yours.

 -- pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>
